  "description": "Reads a DeepSharp pipeline's rows out of Microsoft's DataFrame, Microsoft.Data.Analysis, or out of anything that can fill one: a comma-separated file, a database query, rows somebody already had. One reader for the long tail of formats, so the pipeline itself needs none of them. An absent value stays absent rather than becoming a not-a-number, because never-there and arithmetic-went-wrong are different answers.",
